sn35.140:1.3 | S: Since the eye is produced by what is impermanent, how could it be permanent? | T: As the eye has originated from what is impermanent, how could it be permanent?
sn35.140:1.4 | S: The ear … nose … tongue … body … | T: “The ear is impermanent….
